&apos;Paid Social - Branding&apos;,&apos;Paid Social (Reach / RMA)&apos;,&apos;SEM (non-brand)&apos;,&apos;SEM Brand&apos;,&apos;Affiliate&apos;,&#13;
&apos;App RMO&apos;,&apos;Display RMO&apos;,&apos;Paid Social RMO&apos;)&#13;
)&#13;
&#13;
